  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Land Managm KTH 8-10</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Land Managm. KTH 8-10</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A new round of the programme &quot;Master of Science in Land Management&quot; will be held at the Royal Institute of Technology (KTH) in Stockholm. Students from Russia, Ukraine, Moldova, Armenia, Georgia, Kazakstan, Uzbekistan, Kirgizistan and Tadzjikistan will participate. 32 students per year will be selected during a three years period.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett program f&#xf6;r &quot;Master of Science in Land management&quot; startar p&#xe5; nytt p&#xe5; KTH och ska undervisa studerande fr&#xe5;n Ryssland, Ukraina, Moldavien, Armenien, Georgien, Kazakstan, Uzbekistan, Kirgizistan och Tadzjikistan. 32 studenter per &#xe5;r skall antas under tre &#xe5;r.</narrative>
  </description>
